content.content:
commit 44776fe842c49290f7590e272d2e22a1a59c0c8d
Author: Matthijs van Henten <[REDACTED-EMAIL]>
Date:   Tue Sep 29 04:31:44 2026 +0000

    fix(web): tighten text hits, clear the toolbar and fill the wide row

    - Text hits on the box of its wrapped lines, widest line by all lines,
      for pick and eraser; the handles stay on the wrap-width box, and a
      selected text outlines both.
    - The note and text editor pans the board clear of the toolbar and the
      presence floater, as it already did for the keyboard, keeping Done
      above the keyboard.
    - Fill-off is a slashed square, and the Pen style icon is a full-width
      tapered stroke.
    - The wide row gains the shapes and the fill toggle, and shrinks its
      buttons to 32 px below 1280 px so it stays on one line at 960 px.

